      "description": "<p>Fixed (1.3.1):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed out of raid stuttering. Thanks for reporting these issues.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Features (1.3.0):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Added new option AutoHandleQuestsThatFailOther to not handle quests that fail other quests. (default: off) Quests like (Supply Plans, Kind of Sabotage, etc.)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Performance optimizations(1.3.0):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Added new expert-option to config the WaitForSeconds value with minimum of 0 and maximum of 0.5 seconds (default: 0.3) do not change these values if you do not know what this is for.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Please report any bugs or problems you encounter by creating an issue here: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/PMouse23/SPT-TaskAutomation/issues\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/PMouse23/SPT-TaskAutomation/issues</a></p>\n",
