      "version": "1.2.0",
      "description": "<p>New Features / Options:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The keyboard shortcut to clear in-memory declined quest conditions (default: <strong>ctrl + r</strong>) now also restarts the coroutine. This change was made based on user feedback regarding potential issues that could not be reproduced by the developer.</li>\n<li>When the Debug setting is enabled, pressing <strong>ctrl + i</strong> will start an investigation to verify whether the coroutine is correctly set up.\nIf something is wrong, an error message will be shown in the notifications.\nIf everything is working correctly, the time since the coroutine last ran (in seconds) and the number of remaining tasks will be displayed.</li>\n</ul>\n",
